{"nodes": [{"id": "discoverer_neo_docs_master_plan_checkpoints_phase_2_2_checkpoint", "label": "Phase 2.2 checkpoint \u2014 Wire Run, and the error surface", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/master-plan/checkpoints/PHASE_2.2_CHECKPOINT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "discoverer_neo_docs_master_plan_checkpoints_phase_2_2_checkpoint_radix_portal", "label": "Radix portal blind spot (the 'silent failure' was an observation error)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/master-plan/checkpoints/PHASE_2.2_CHECKPOINT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An audit reported Run as dead (no network request, no console error, no toast) on a migrated worksheet. Every observation was correct and also exactly what a working modal parameter gate looks like: Radix renders the Run parameters dialog through a portal into <body>, but the audit's page reads were scoped to <main>, so the dialog was invisible to them. Any check reading <main> or using get_page_text (which defaults to article/main) will falsely report a working modal as dead; verification must screenshot or query [role=dialog]."}, {"id": "discoverer_neo_docs_master_plan_checkpoints_phase_2_2_checkpoint_refusal_contract", "label": "Refusal contract: backend `code` maps to `kind: REFUSED`, not English-message regex matching", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/master-plan/checkpoints/PHASE_2.2_CHECKPOINT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "discoverer_neo_docs_master_plan_checkpoints_phase_2_2_checkpoint_error_boundary", "label": "App error boundary, RouteFallback, i18n error path, SEC-07 ORA- suppression", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/master-plan/checkpoints/PHASE_2.2_CHECKPOINT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "discoverer_neo_docs_master_plan_checkpoints_phase_2_2_checkpoint_translated_fallback", "label": "Translated fallback by default via i18next instance, not a required parameter", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/master-plan/checkpoints/PHASE_2.2_CHECKPOINT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The plan review asked for a required translated fallback parameter on getErrorMessage, which would mean editing 53 call sites. Resolving the default through the already-imported i18next instance gives the same no-English-leak guarantee in three lines instead of 53 edits, while still letting callers pass something more specific."}, {"id": "discoverer_neo_docs_master_plan_checkpoints_phase_2_2_checkpoint_client_no_guess", "label": "The client does not guess entitlement \u2014 only 'no output columns' is a client-side disabled reason", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/master-plan/checkpoints/PHASE_2.2_CHECKPOINT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "FORBIDDEN (entitlement) and CONNECT (data-source unreachable) are only knowable from the server, so they surface as post-click errors rather than a pre-emptive disabled state. Inventing a client-side entitlement check would have been a lie about what the client actually knows."}, {"id": "frontend_src_app", "label": "App.tsx (frontend route tree, Suspense fallback gaps)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/master-plan/checkpoints/PHASE_2.2_CHECKPOINT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "frontend_src_components_ui_dialog", "label": "dialog.tsx (hard-coded English 'Close' sr-only span)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/master-plan/checkpoints/PHASE_2.2_CHECKPOINT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "frontend_src_components_ui_sheet", "label": "sheet.tsx (hard-coded English 'Close' sr-only span)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/master-plan/checkpoints/PHASE_2.2_CHECKPOINT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "backend_src_map_execution", "label": "map-execution.ts (KIND_STATUS, FORBIDDEN execution-error kind)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/master-plan/checkpoints/PHASE_2.2_CHECKPOINT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "backend_src___tests___sql_generator_test", "label": "backend/src/__tests__/sql-generator.test.ts (D-014 MULTI_FOLDER_AGGREGATE refusal test)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/master-plan/checkpoints/PHASE_2.2_CHECKPOINT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "frontend_src___tests___map_viewer_run_test", "label": "frontend/src/__tests__/map-viewer-run.test.tsx (Run + parameter prompt + error boundary tests)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/master-plan/checkpoints/PHASE_2.2_CHECKPOINT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "frontend_src___tests___execution_panel_test", "label": "frontend/src/__tests__/execution-panel.test.tsx (CONFIG/QUERY headline + refusal render tests)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/master-plan/checkpoints/PHASE_2.2_CHECKPOINT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "discoverer_neo_docs_master_plan_checkpoints_phase_2_2_checkpoint", "target": "discoverer_neo_docs_master_plan_checkpoints_phase_2_2_checkpoint_radix_portal", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "